    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660ec81ac891c06e735362ff</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660ec81ac891c06e735362ff</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Apr 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><p><span>作为一个纯血广西人，今天来给吃粉正名！谁说螺蛳粉是臭的？老友粉为什么传不出去？桂林米粉到底是什么味啊？</span></p><p><span>广西到底有多少粉？正宗的螺蛳粉、老友粉、桂林米粉到底是什么样的？</span></p><p><span>怎么吃更好吃？有没有推荐的店？</span></p><p><span>……</span></p><p><span>主播：到处去旅游的罗丧失</span></p><p><span>剪辑/文案：罗丧失</span></p><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 哪些地方在吃粉？吃的又是些什么粉？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> 广西境内有哪些粉？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 南宁老友粉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 桂林米粉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1594">26:34</a> 螺蛳粉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2156">35:56</a> 推荐一些南宁的粉店：</span></p><p><span>老友粉：天福香、舒记、复记、猪霸王</span></p><p><span>螺蛳粉：西环肥仔、爱民、螺公堂</span></p><p><span>桂林米粉：发源地、红鼻子</span></p><p><span>【BGM】Jordyn Edmonds - Mystery</span></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>【旷野Radio】厂牌旗下栏目</span></p><p><span>都市男女的情感职场必备：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a"><span>罗丧失和金子的客厅</span></a></p><p><span>普通人个人成长与搞钱：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7"><span>金子的书房</span></a></p><p><span>寻找自己，遇见世界，有趣人类都在听的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b"><span>旷野地图</span></a></p><p><span>替你的职场扫清障碍的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445"><span>旷野地雷</span></a></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>欢迎大家添加微信小助手：SangsaL，加入我们的听友群，与海内外热辣的朋友们一起挖掘当代有趣人类的多元生活方式~</span></p>]]></description>
