    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><p><span>延吉是我东北之行第一站（延吉，沈阳，大连），延吉的花销如何？吃什么？怎么玩？一站式搞定。</span></p><p><span>延吉真的太好吃了！也很宜居。在这里我体会到了红色教育的深度，对爱国也有了不同的体会！</span></p><p><span>下次去真的要带着你的护照，且多带一个胃！</span></p><p><span>……</span></p><p><span>主播：到处去旅游的罗丧失</span></p><p><span>剪辑/文案：罗丧失</span></p><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 延吉的花销总计</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 延吉的飞机：感觉像在出国。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> DAY1：延边博物馆+兴豆饭店：炸酱面、锅包肉、米酒+西市场+网红墙-人民公园-布尔哈通河水上音乐喷泉</span></p><p><span>炸酱面+锅包肉：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft9yulMpFC6XScFX8xYgm17-281q.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">19:38</a> DAY2：珲春图们一日游+韩式生腌、酱油蛋饭</span></p><p><span>生腌外卖：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm_fndQlpJUgbR_aXwPH0pRlY3ge.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a> DAY3：顺姬冷面+觅屿海棠民俗园写真+帽儿山森林公园+本达人雪蟹炒饭</span></p><p><span>大冷面：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fii0RH2Yx0bmOYT5B6eSYU05DAWy.jpg"></figure><p><span>民族写真：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrZGLSYr2WcNS3tqTsoQNXC7CrAi.jpg"></figure><p><span>本达人雪蟹：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-AtXbnQ_rlFSfBVj_d5IplzZ0U.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> DAY4：梨花汤馆狗肉汤</span></p><p><span>好好喝，北京没有T T</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvsZ5BfBka4Pe4Pjr9mJvc0ps3fW.jpg"></figure><p><span>【BGM】Jordyn Edmonds - Mystery</span></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>【旷野Radio】厂牌旗下栏目</span></p><p><span>都市男女的情感职场必备：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a"><span>罗丧失和金子的客厅</span></a></p><p><span>普通人个人成长与搞钱：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7" data-url="