  <item>
    <title>英国 | 18天低成本伦敦苏格兰深度游，体验雾都生活！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/659667b92e26fb9934837381</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">659667b92e26fb9934837381</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jan 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>继上一期和赵无敌聊英国之后，激发了金子对四年前英国旅行的怀念。于是金子翻出了四年前的聊天记录和相册，把2019年末到2020年初的英国旅行做了一个深度复盘。</span></p><span></span><p><span>18天的旅行中，有15天是在伦敦及郊区游玩，3天在爱丁堡。共计打卡了6个公园，2所大学，3个博物馆和各种知名打卡点。因为时间较为久远，可能会出现描述错误的地方，欢迎大家指正！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播/剪辑：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ee8669c000000000101dde3?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5ee8669c000000000101dde3&amp;apptime=1705029361" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ee8669c000000000101dde3?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5ee8669c000000000101dde3&amp;apptime=1705029361"><span>金子</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 异国他乡的交通、住宿、吃饭，方方面面如何省钱！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv8JGe6HeGfP4fV-RDze0qurymll.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> 每天出门没多久天就黑了？英国的冬天，白昼很短夜很长。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> 金子在英国的“佛系旅行”法：睡到自然醒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSlf-STB2ixSJYCRvnaUAhVpzsP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a> 伦敦citywalk，走两步就进公园。第一个国家公园城市真的名不虚传！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a> 被锁在肯辛顿公园的经历：逛公园前，先看看几点关门！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjy9Gze-BY5_vkUwfXHJ1pH3cthe.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> 格林威治天文台：步行三小时，只为了看那一根本初子午线</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv8rtC_eJNWuuokzGHeMVJUC3qC9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 英国当地市集，年末的Winterwonderland，不可错过的沉浸式过节氛围</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkVJYRGJuzcy61Mo1wbT6SePiVp-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> 伦敦有多少博物馆？大英博物馆、科学博物馆、福尔摩斯博物馆……根本逛不完！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1689">28:09</a> 伦敦的戏剧文化：话剧、舞剧、音乐剧……伦敦人的闲暇时间，很忙很有情调！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq40qL44dah5unsj6VJgpovQ3Nx1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2199">36:39</a> 打卡UCL和剑桥大学，英国大学的教学楼像公园一样散布在城市各处！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsZAdK25MdbgsBG25IcL3FEasGCf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2481">41:21</a> 9又1/4站台，热红酒，元旦烟花秀……回忆过往的情绪，才发现未来如此不可知。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2814">46:54</a> 苏格兰自驾游：爱丁堡古城、厄克特城堡Urquhart Castle和格林芬纳路。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm-tYa87IykTL_GQ-vH_7xiMUSK5.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnPq39fH0MUhcgk5jzhW8lVqNc80.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a> 伦敦动物园：离开英国前的最后一站。这里的小动物活得很开心！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3269">54:29</a> 购物和吃饭：连锁店primark上大分！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】Jordyn Edmonds - Mystery</span></p><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><p><span>【旷野Radio】厂牌旗下栏目</span></p><span></span><p><span>都市男女的情感职场必备：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a"><span>罗丧失和金子的客厅</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>普通人个人成长与搞钱：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7"><span>金子的书房</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>寻找自己，遇见世界，有趣人类都在听的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b"><span>旷野地图</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>替你的职场扫清障碍的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445"><span>旷野地雷</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家添加微信小助手：SangsaL 或者 jinzi_0810，加入我们的听友群，与海内外热辣的朋友们一起挖掘当代有趣人类的多元生活方式~</span></p>]]></description>
