    <title>日本 | 花1w+玩12天4城，硬核旅行攻略分享！语言不通也快乐！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6556fc8a51ba721857eaa2ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6556fc8a51ba721857eaa2ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Nov 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><p><span>本期是上期日本出行的【旅游攻略】版：</span></p><p><span>1w+日本玩两周，【奢侈版穷游】是如何展开的？</span></p><p><span>只身一人去日本，语言不通也能快乐出游！</span></p><p><span>出行前要做哪些准备？带什么东西？一站式搞定。</span></p><p><span>日本有什么必去的景点？好吃的美食？</span></p><p><span>……</span></p><p><span>本期节目，是罗丧失12天日本行（大阪，京都，奈良，东京）的攻略大分享，这次录制因为流感拖了一阵，录制期间也没有完全好转，所以语速会慢一些，建议1.5倍速食用！</span></p><p><span>主播：</span></p><p><span>GAP到处去旅游的罗丧失</span></p><p><span>剪辑：罗丧失</span></p><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 丝滑出入关，不必同机场进出关，订票别害怕！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 护照和签证：抓住各个城市签证信息差，10w存款就能走！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 日本国内交通：用好周游卡和交通卡！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 日本吃喝花销：只要你想，30rmb/天又有何不可？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 日本的住宿花销。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 日本景点门票费</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a> 如何将花销控制在1w元？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 出行前必下APP：攻略类/出行类/翻译类/外汇类，一网打尽！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 12天换多少日币合适？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 出国在外，不一定全靠导航，你可以看看手册！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 行李带什么？带不带转换头？10月穿什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> 大阪4日游行程+景点+美食</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvlLNzNROZsvQz25yAqjfxJ_XAlj.jpeg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq9urPW6aRZf_jzRBv5vs8sa-P3Y.jpeg"></figure><p><span>猪排咖喱饭</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsCMOjtNB10NBFOKKRIVLiHCYX6N.jpeg"></figure><p><span>麻婆豆腐饭</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlANncOMjjaNdZFw3bPetAUyCXUI.jpeg"></figure><p><span>天津饭</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMH-SjY6txvYZZuLc455ANuo1ho.jpeg"></figure><p><span>大阪章鱼丸</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpYMgoVSmDC43w9XjXvjWuza1OG7.jpeg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 京都2日游行程+景点+美食</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk191RtTCTFodgONo8F9c01wVlrW.jpeg"></figure><p><span>鸡汤沾面</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpXi6CjaoJ3RlUnQ4JyVnBIZ8Ygk.jpeg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 奈良2日游行程+景点+美食</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg-cS3iC3ChhWT0xMQ3WJDtAH4iD.jpeg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpCKCHL_fWL-VjbtyBOJIa-pdFtc.jpeg"></figure><p><span>乌冬面</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvksIEM5Rx9EeNPTclb1EB0lekVY.jpeg"></figure><p><span>釜饭</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrVsdXvlaDEIy36LAC07kzwOs_eW.jpeg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 东京4日游行程+景点+美食</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkSJv9_zsRZd1nRPs9S8fjRBv56s.jpeg"></figure><p><span>拉面煎饺</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlRuVilqIRAHkzDS3-MZboMv_Sgl.jpeg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 那些被日本治愈和开悟的瞬间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">66:00</a> 日本旅游季节推荐</span></p><p><span>【BGM】Jordyn Edmonds - Mystery</span></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>【旷野Radio】厂牌旗下栏目</span></p><p><span>都市男女的情感职场必备：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a"><span>罗丧失和金子的客厅</span></a></p><p><span>普通人个人成长与搞钱：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7"><span>金子的书房</span></a></p><p><span>寻找自己，遇见世界，有趣人类都在听的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b"><span>旷野地图</span></a></p><p><span>替你的职场扫清障碍的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445"><span>旷野地雷</span></a></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>欢迎大家添加微信小助手：SangsaL，加入我们的听友群，与海内外热辣的朋友们一起挖掘当代有趣人类的多元生活方式~</span></p>]]></description>
